OL,3,GNEWSA'AI cameras could tackle
OL,4,Awidespread culture of dangerous driving
OL,5,Abehaviours'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn artificial intelligence trial which
OL,8,Funcovered nearly 19,000 potential
OL,9,Fdriving offences in two weeks has
OL,10,Fhighlighted a "huge problem" with
OL,11,Fdriving behaviours in the West
OL,12,FMidlands, said the region's first road
OL,13,Fsafety commissioner.
OL,15,FAI-powered cameras installed outside
OL,16,FLadywood fire station in Birmingham and
OL,17,FFallings Park in Wolverhampton,
OL,18,Fcaptured drivers holding mobile phones
OL,19,Fat the wheel and failing to wear
OL,20,Fseatbelts. One image appeared to
OL,21,Fcapture someone drinking from a wine
OL,22,Fbottle at the wheel.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
