OL,3,GNEWSA'AI cameras could tackle
OL,4,Awidespread culture of dangerous driving
OL,5,Abehaviours'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMat MacDonald said another image which
OL,8,Fshowed a child "sitting unrestrained on
OL,9,Fa front passenger's lap," was
OL,10,F"particularly shocking".
OL,12,FHe said the findings pointed to a
OL,13,F"widespread culture" of dangerous
OL,14,Fdriving behaviours.
